  "activation_checklist_after_v3_final_sha": [
    "Re-pin middleware.v3_final_sha and re-verify the vendored schema pin against Middleware at that SHA",
    "Confirm app/secret_reference.py (or its V3 successor) still rejects forbidden keys and secret-shaped strings at every depth",
    "Confirm the V3 command payload, outbox, ledger, audit, log, metric and trace schemas carry no secret value fields (Middleware-side guard)",
    "Run scripts/certify_staging_identity.py for middleware-api-staging and middleware-worker-staging",
